---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import DreamNumberSearch from '../components/DreamNumberSearch';
import TeerFormulaCalculator from '../components/TeerFormulaCalculator';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Shillong Teer Dream Number List (A-Z) • Target Numbers | Teer Live"
  description="Complete A-Z Shillong Teer dream number list & calculator. Search dream symbols (snake, money, water, fish) in English, বাংলা (Bangla) & Hindi for House, Ending & Direct hit numbers."
>
  <div class="space-y-6">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: 'Dream Numbers' }]} />

    <header class="bg-white border-2 border-amber-400 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-6 text-slate-900 space-y-3 shadow-xs ring-4 ring-amber-50">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-2">
        <h1 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>🌙</span>
          <span>Shillong Teer Dream Number Directory &amp; Calculator</span>
        </h1>
        <span class="text-xs bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 font-black border border-amber-300 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full shadow-2xs">
          ● A-Z Complete List
        </span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">
        In Khasi archery tradition, dreams have been correlated with symbolic hit numbers for over a century. Use our interactive search tool below to look up your dream in English, Assamese, Bengali, or Hindi to find traditional Direct, House, and Ending target numbers.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Cross-Game Quick Navigation Hub -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 overflow-x-auto text-xs py-1 scrollbar-none">
      <span class="text-slate-500 font-bold whitespace-nowrap text-[11px]">Quick Switch:</span>
      <a href="/shillong-teer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 bg-white border border-amber-300 text-amber-800 font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg hover:bg-amber-50 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shadow-2xs">
        <span>🎯</span>
        <span>Shillong Teer Live</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/khanapara-teer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 bg-white border border-emerald-300 text-emerald-800 font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg hover:bg-emerald-50 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shadow-2xs">
        <span>🎯</span>
        <span>Khanapara Teer Live</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/juwai-teer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 bg-white border border-blue-300 text-blue-800 font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-50 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shadow-2xs">
        <span>🎯</span>
        <span>Juwai Teer Live</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/previous-results" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 bg-white border border-slate-300 text-slate-700 font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shadow-2xs">
        <span>📊</span>
        <span>Past Archive</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Interactive Dream Search Engine -->
    <DreamNumberSearch client:idle />

    <!-- Mathematical Formula Cross-Validation -->
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <div class="border-l-4 border-amber-500 pl-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-slate-900">
          Cross-Verify Dream Numbers with Mathematical Formula
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">
          Experienced Teer players compare dream symbols with mathematical house/ending calculations from yesterday's results.
        </p>
      </div>
      <TeerFormulaCalculator client:visible />
    </div>

    <!-- Categorized A-Z Dream Interpretation Guide -->
    <section class="bg-white border border-slate-200/90 rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-7 text-slate-700 space-y-6 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed shadow-xs">
      <header class="border-b border-slate-100 pb-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-xl font-black text-slate-900">
          Complete Guide to Traditional Teer Dream Numbers
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">
          A century-old folkloric tradition from the hills of Meghalaya and Assam.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900">
          Cultural Origins of Dream Interpretation in Meghalaya
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          Long before modern statistical analysis, archery participants across the Khasi, Jaintia, and Ri-Bhoi hills relied on symbolic interpretation of overnight dreams. In indigenous folklore, everyday sights and nocturnal encounters—such as crossing clean rivers, seeing dangerous snakes, or encountering ancestors—are believed to vibrate with numerical frequencies.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Reference Table of Top Dream Symbols -->
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900">
          Most Common Teer Dream Symbols &amp; Hit Numbers Table
        </h3>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-left text-xs border border-slate-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden font-mono mt-2">
            <thead class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 font-black uppercase text-[11px] border-b border-slate-200">
              <tr>
                <th class="p-2.5 sm:p-3">Dream Symbol</th>
                <th class="p-2.5 sm:p-3">Bengali / Hindi</th>
                <th class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 text-amber-800">Direct Numbers</th>
                <th class="p-2.5 sm:p-3">House</th>
                <th class="p-2.5 sm:p-3">Ending</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100 text-slate-700">
              <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50">
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold text-slate-900">Snake / Serpent</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-sans">সাপ / सांप</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-black text-amber-700">07, 70, 09, 89</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold">0, 7, 9</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold">7, 0, 9</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50">
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold text-slate-900">Clean Water / River</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-sans">জল / নদী / पानी</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-black text-amber-700">04, 40, 07, 74</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold">0, 4, 7</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold">4, 7, 2</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50">
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold text-slate-900">Money / Cash Notes</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-sans">টাকা / पैसा / धन</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-black text-amber-700">00, 11, 22, 33, 44</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold">0, 5</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold">0, 5</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50">
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold text-slate-900">Fish / Catching Fish</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-sans">মাছ / मछली</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-black text-amber-700">06, 60, 66, 03</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold">6, 3</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold">6, 0, 3</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50">
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold text-slate-900">Dead Body / Funeral</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-sans">মৃতদেহ / লাশ / शव</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-black text-amber-700">14, 41, 04, 44</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold">1, 4</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold">4, 1</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50">
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold text-slate-900">Doctor / Hospital</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-sans">ডাক্তার / अस्पताल</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-black text-amber-700">10, 01, 11, 91</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold">1, 0</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold">0, 1</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50">
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold text-slate-900">Tooth Falling Out</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-sans">দাঁত পড়া / दांत गिरना</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-black text-amber-700">13, 31, 03, 33</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold">1, 3</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold">3, 1</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50">
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold text-slate-900">Cow / Bull / Buffalo</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-sans">গরু / ষাঁড় / गाय</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-black text-amber-700">12, 21, 22, 52</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold">1, 2</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 font-bold">2, 1</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900">
          How to Combine Dream Numbers with Daily Common Formulas
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          Experienced players rarely rely on dream numbers alone. The standard practice in Shillong, Khanapara, and Guwahati is to:
        </p>
        <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-600">
          <li><strong>Identify your dream symbol:</strong> Search for the primary object or action in our dictionary above.</li>
          <li><strong>Extract the House and Ending:</strong> Note down the recommended tens and units digits.</li>
          <li><strong>Cross-reference with yesterday's results:</strong> Run yesterday's FR and SR numbers through the <a href="#formula-calculator" class="text-amber-700 font-bold hover:underline">Teer Formula Calculator</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Filter matching pairs:</strong> If your dream symbol shares a House or Ending with the mathematical formula, that target number has higher historical confirmation.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick FAQs -->
      <div class="border-t border-slate-100 pt-4 space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900">
          Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)
        </h3>
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <details class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-3 cursor-pointer">
            <summary class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm">Can dream numbers guarantee a 100% win in Teer?</summary>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-600">No. Dream numbers are rooted in centuries-old tribal folklore and symbolic traditions. Actual winning numbers in Shillong, Khanapara, and Juwai depend solely on the verified arrow counts recorded by licensed referees.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-3 cursor-pointer">
            <summary class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm">What should I do if I see multiple symbols in one dream?</summary>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-600">If your dream features both a snake (House 9) and water (House 4), look for overlap or cross-pairings such as 49 or 94. Focus on the most vivid emotion or the central object of the dream.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-3 cursor-pointer">
            <summary class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm">Can I use these dream numbers for Khanapara and Juwai Teer?</summary>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-600">Yes. The symbolic dream numbers dictionary is universally followed across Northeast India, including Shillong Teer, Khanapara Teer (Guwahati), Juwai Teer, and Night Teer.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-3 cursor-pointer">
            <summary class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm">How do I search for a dream in Bengali or Hindi?</summary>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-600">You can type either English terms (e.g. "snake"), Hindi (e.g. "सांप"), or Bengali (e.g. "সাপ") in the search box above to instantly filter matching rows.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
